      "contact.r2t": "A refund, or a charge you did not expect",
      "contact.r2b": "Google Play is the seller, so refunds are Google's to give and are requested from your Play order history, not from us. We cannot issue one and cannot cancel a subscription for you. If Google has already said no and you think that is wrong, write to us with the order number and we will help you make the case.",
