      "contact.r4b": "The app has its own feedback screen, under your profile, and it attaches the technical details for you, so that is the best route. If you use the form instead, include your phone model, your Android version, the screen you were on and a screenshot. Those four things usually decide whether it is fixed in one reply or three.",
